{
  "name": "gemma-search",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "type": "module",
  "description": "本地素材库语义检索（EmbeddingGemma 2）· 引擎与桌面应用",
  "main": "./out/main/index.js",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "node scripts/electron-vite.mjs dev",
    "start": "node scripts/electron-vite.mjs preview",
    "build": "electron-vite build",
    "build:unpack": "npm run build && electron-builder --dir",
    "smoke": "node tools/smoke_app.mjs",
    "build:win": "npm run build && electron-builder --win",
    "start:legacy": "electron archive/app-shell-20261010/main/bootstrap.cjs",
    "test": "node --test --test-isolation=none \"tests/*.test.mjs\"",
    "test:watch": "node --test --watch --test-isolation=none \"tests/*.test.mjs\"",
    "dev:restricted": "node scripts/electron-vite.mjs dev --noSandbox --entry out/main/index.js",
    "start:restricted": "node scripts/electron-vite.mjs preview --noSandbox --entry out/main/index.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@huggingface/transformers": "^4.3.1",
    "@radix-ui/react-alert-dialog": "^1.1.24",
    "@radix-ui/react-checkbox": "^1.3.12",
    "@radix-ui/react-dialog": "^1.2.0",
    "@radix-ui/react-dropdown-menu": "^2.1.25",
    "@radix-ui/react-label": "^2.1.16",
    "@radix-ui/react-popover": "^1.2.0",
    "@radix-ui/react-select": "^2.3.8",
    "@radix-ui/react-slot": "^1.4.0",
    "@radix-ui/react-switch": "^1.3.8",
    "@radix-ui/react-tabs": "^1.1.22",
    "@radix-ui/react-toast": "^1.2.24",
    "@radix-ui/react-tooltip": "^1.3.0",
    "@tanstack/react-virtual": "^3.14.14",
    "bmp-js": "^0.1.0",
    "class-variance-authority": "^0.7.1",
    "clsx": "^2.1.1",
    "lucide-react": "^1.55.0",
    "react": "^19.3.0",
    "react-dom": "^19.3.0",
    "sharp": "^0.35.5",
    "tailwind-merge": "^3.7.0",
    "zod": "^4.6.5",
    "zustand": "^5.0.15"
  },
  "//": [
    "P1 引擎刻意**零依赖**：只用 Node 内置能力（node:test / node:crypto / node:fs）。",
    "理由一：core/ 必须传输无关，零依赖是这一点的最强形式（也不可能 import electron）。",
    "理由二：受限沙箱下 `npm install` 会因 npm 用管道捕获子进程输出而 EPERM。",
    "P2（2026-10-10）已装 zod（IPC 参数校验）与 electron（外壳）；两者都只被 main/preload 用到。",
    "sharp 必须**显式声明**：它本是 @huggingface/transformers 的可选传递依赖，",
    "而 src/main 的编码路径（重采样兼容层）直接 import 它 —— 靠传递依赖迟早会断。",
    "externals：electron.vite.config.mjs 把 dependencies 全部列为 external（原生模块不能进 bundle）。",
    "**刻意没有 typecheck 脚本**：迁移期的 main/preload/renderer 还是普通 JS，",
    "打开 checkJs 会报 222 条 noImplicitAny（实测），而把 `any` 撒进去只是把红灯涂绿。",
    "tsconfig.*.json 已按 electron-vite 两段布局写好，P3a 转 TS 时直接接上并恢复 typecheck 门禁。"
  ],
  "devDependencies": {
    "@tailwindcss/vite": "^4.3.3",
    "@types/node": "^26.6.5",
    "@types/react": "^19.3.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.3.0",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^5.2.0",
    "electron": "^44.7.0",
    "electron-builder": "^26.15.3",
    "electron-vite": "^5.0.0",
    "jsdom": "^29.1.1",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.3.3",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2",
    "vite": "^7.3.7",
    "vitest": "^5.0.3"
  }
}
